<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  A cloud with DAV in it. Drawn from the supplied icon set (artwork/launcher/), which builds
  the outline as a union of two circles and a pill minus the same union scaled to 0.76, and
  sets the letters in Archivo 900.

  A vector drawable has neither masks nor text, so both were resolved here: the outline is the
  exact boundary of that union, five arcs out and five back with an even-odd fill between them,
  and the letters are the font's own outlines. The result was checked against the set's 432px
  render: the outline matches to the pixel and the letters to a quarter of a dp.

  One colour of fill, so the same drawable is also the Android 13 monochrome layer.
-->
